{"id":"613341045cd27d2d","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-comb9-shattering-family.md","title":"ZFC Comb9 Shattering Family","display":"df-zfc-comb9-shattering-family — ZFC Comb9 Shattering Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb9-shattering-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb9-shattering-family"],"display":"df-zfc-comb9-shattering-family — ZFC Comb9 Shattering Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb9-shattering-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb9-shattering-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb9-shattering-family — ZFC Comb9 Shattering Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S,X,A,S\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal S,X,A,S\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SplittingFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SplittingFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (correctly named predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9ShatteringFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9ShatteringFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\n\\land\\forall A\\in[X]^\\omega\\;\\exists S\\in\\mathcal S\\;\n(|A\\cap S|=\\omega\\land|A\\setminus S|=\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\n\\land\\forall A\\in[X]^\\omega\\;\\exists S\\in\\mathcal S\\;\n(|A\\cap S|=\\omega\\land|A\\setminus S|=\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}shattering\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9ShatteringFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}shattering\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9ShatteringFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed property is splitting of every countably infinite subset, not VC shattering. The legacy predicate name is retained only as a compatibility alias; VC shattering is defined in <code>58-df-zfc-comb7-shattering-family</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anch